+# Parallelization Plan — v0.7 Release (Phase 1)
+
+## Execution Mode
+
+Hybrid — twelve Wave-1 tasks run in parallel from the feature branch tip, followed by eight more waves that mix parallel fan-out (where file sets are disjoint) with sequential chains (where a single file is edited by successive tasks across waves).
